---
import { Leaf as LeafIcon } from '@lucide/astro';

const stats = [
  { value: 100, suffix: '+', label: 'gian hàng artist' },
  { value: 8, suffix: '', label: 'khu trải nghiệm' },
  { value: 0, suffix: 'đ', label: 'vé vào cửa' },
  { value: 7, suffix: 'h', label: 'quẩy hết mình' },
];
---

<section class="story section" id="chu-de" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="container story__grid">
    <div class="story__art" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="sprout" viewBox="0 0 320 420" data-sprout>
        <!-- wasteland rubble -->
        <g class="rubble">
          <path d="M20 400c30-30 70-36 110-22 30-24 80-28 120-6 24-8 44-4 60 10v38H20Z" fill="#c9a77f" stroke="#1f3a4d" stroke-width="3"></path>
          <rect x="54" y="352" width="44" height="30" rx="6" fill="#8a9aa8" stroke="#1f3a4d" stroke-width="3" transform="rotate(-14 76 367)"></rect>
          <circle cx="250" cy="372" r="16" fill="#e8a33d" stroke="#1f3a4d" stroke-width="3"></circle>
          <path d="M196 386l18-34 22 30Z" fill="#9fb3c2" stroke="#1f3a4d" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </g>
        <!-- stem draws itself while scrolling -->
        <path
          class="stem"
          data-draw
          d="M160 392C150 330 176 290 158 236s-34-90 4-140c18-24 22-46 14-70"
          fill="none"
          stroke="#23934a"
          stroke-width="12"
          stroke-linecap="round"></path>
        <g class="leaves">
          <path data-leaf data-origin="160 330" d="M160 330c-40-6-70-30-78-62 36-2 66 18 78 62Z" fill="#7ed957" stroke="#1f3a4d" stroke-width="3"></path>
          <path data-leaf data-origin="164 270" d="M164 270c38-12 74-6 96 18-30 16-70 12-96-18Z" fill="#a8f0c6" stroke="#1f3a4d" stroke-width="3"></path>
          <path data-leaf data-origin="150 190" d="M150 190c-34-22-48-56-40-86 30 14 46 46 40 86Z" fill="#4cbf5d" stroke="#1f3a4d" stroke-width="3"></path>
          <path data-leaf data-origin="168 128" d="M168 128c26-28 60-38 90-28-18 28-52 38-90 28Z" fill="#8fe39b" stroke="#1f3a4d" stroke-width="3"></path>
        </g>
        <g class="bloom" data-bloom>
          <circle cx="176" cy="26" r="14" fill="#ffd447" stroke="#1f3a4d" stroke-width="3"></circle>
          <g fill="#ff7aa2" stroke="#1f3a4d" stroke-width="3">
            <ellipse cx="176" cy="2" rx="11" ry="14"></ellipse>
            <ellipse cx="200" cy="22" rx="14" ry="11"></ellipse>
            <ellipse cx="190" cy="48" rx="11" ry="13" transform="rotate(-30 190 48)"></ellipse>
            <ellipse cx="160" cy="48" rx="11" ry="13" transform="rotate(30 160 48)"></ellipse>
            <ellipse cx="152" cy="22" rx="14" ry="11"></ellipse>
          </g>
          <circle cx="176" cy="26" r="12" fill="#ffd447"></circle>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="story__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-reveal><LeafIcon aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" /> Chủ đề Vol.21</span>
      <h2 id="story-title" class="section-title" data-reveal>
        Wasteland — <span class="highlight">khi nghệ thuật hồi sinh</span> sự sống
      </h2>
      <div class="story__text">
        <p data-words>
          Giữa tàn tích cằn cỗi, đôi bàn tay artist đã thi triển “ma thuật” tái sinh vạn vật! Không chỉ đam mê sáng tạo,
          thế hệ họa sĩ còn là những người dẫn đầu lối sống xanh: chắt chiu từng mẩu họa cụ cũ, hô biến phế liệu thành
          kiệt tác.
        </p>
        <p data-words>
          Từng nét cọ chính là lời kêu gọi mạnh mẽ: hãy cùng chung tay bảo vệ môi trường, để viễn cảnh tận thế
          “Wasteland” vĩnh viễn không bao giờ xảy ra ngoài đời thực!
        </p>
        <p class="story__ask" data-reveal>
          Bạn đã sẵn sàng “du lịch” vào vùng đất này và cùng AD vẽ nên những <strong>“sắc xanh hi vọng”</strong>?
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="stats" data-stagger>
        {
          stats.map((s) => (
            <li class="stat sticker">
              <b>
                <span data-count={s.value}>{s.value}</span>
                {s.suffix}
              </b>
              <span>{s.label}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story {
    background:
      radial-gradient(rgb(31 58 77 / 0.08) 1.2px, transparent 1.4px) 0 0 / 22px 22px,
      var(--cream);
  }

  .story__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 36px;
  }

  .story__art {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .sprout {
    width: min(52vw, 260px);
    height: auto;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .story__text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 1.08em;
  }

  /* Word-by-word reveal: JS wraps words in <span class="w">; text is fully readable without JS. */
  .story__text :global(.w) {
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .story__ask {
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border-left: 6px solid var(--leaf);
    border-radius: 0 16px 16px 0;
    background: rgb(168 240 198 / 0.45);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 32px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink);
  }

  .stat:nth-child(1) {
    background: var(--sun-soft);
  }

  .stat:nth-child(2) {
    background: var(--sky-mist);
  }

  .stat:nth-child(3) {
    background: #ffe1e6;
  }

  .stat:nth-child(4) {
    background: #e2f8ea;
  }

  .stat b {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 2.8rem);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat > span {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .stats {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .story__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 64px;
    }

    .story__art {
      position: sticky;
      top: 110px;
      align-self: start;
    }

    .sprout {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 380px;
    }
  }
</style>
